The import statement references `VueTypes` which does not exist in the types.ts file. The types.ts file only exports `VueRenderer`. 

Looking at the React implementation, it has a `ReactTypes` interface that extends `ReactRenderer` with additional parameters. Vue3 needs a similar `VueTypes` type/interface to be defined in types.ts, or this code should use `VueRenderer` instead. 

If following the React pattern, you would need to add to types.ts:
```typescript
export interface VueTypes extends VueRenderer {
  // Add any Vue-specific parameters here if needed
}
```

Alternatively, if no additional types are needed, replace all references to `VueTypes` with `VueRenderer` throughout this file.
